                                                "sense_id": "a7a0cab6-f3d7-3286-8ba2-85cc3cd934b9",
                                                "text": "That daughter there of Spain, the Lady Blanch, / Is near to England: look upon the years / Of Lewis the Dauphin and the lovely maid. / If lusty love should go in quest of beauty, / Where should he find it fairer than in Blanch?"
